{"architectures":["x64"],"id":"blueberrycongee.TermCanvas","latestVersion":"0.39.10","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"An infinite canvas desktop app for visually managing terminals","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/blueberrycongee/termcanvas/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"An infinite canvas desktop app for visually managing terminals","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/blueberrycongee/termcanvas/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"TermCanvas spreads all your terminals across an infinite spatial canvas — no more tabs, no more split panes. Drag them around, zoom in to focus, zoom out to see the big picture.\nIt organizes everything in a Project → Worktree → Terminal hierarchy that mirrors how you actually use git. Add a project, and TermCanvas auto-detects its worktrees. Create a new worktree from the terminal, and it appears on the canvas instantly.","name":"TermCanvas","packageUrl":"https://github.com/blueberrycongee/termcanvas","publisher":"blueberrycongee","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/blueberrycongee","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/blueberrycongee/termcanvas/releases/tag/v0.39.10","tags":["agent","agentic","ai","chatbot","claude-code","code","codex","coding","gemini-cli","large-language-model","llm","programming"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"一款用于可视化管理终端的无限画布桌面应用","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"TermCanvas 可将你所有的终端窗口排布在无限空间画布上——无需再使用标签页，也不必拆分窗格。你可以随意拖动终端，放大即可聚焦单个窗口，缩小就能查看全局布局。\n它采用「项目→工作树→终端」的层级结构管理所有内容，完全贴合你实际使用 Git 的习惯。添加项目后，TermCanvas 会自动检测其包含的工作树；你在终端中创建新工作树时，它也会立刻显示在画布上。","tags":["claude-code","codex","gemini-cli","人工智能","代码","大语言模型","智能体","编程","聊天机器人","自主智能"]}},"longDescription":"TermCanvas spreads all your terminals across an infinite spatial canvas — no more tabs, no more split panes. Drag them around, zoom in to focus, zoom out to see the big picture.\nIt organizes everything in a Project → Worktree → Terminal hierarchy that mirrors how you actually use git. Add a project, and TermCanvas auto-detects its worktrees. Create a new worktree from the terminal, and it appears on the canvas instantly.","name":"TermCanvas","packageUrl":"https://github.com/blueberrycongee/termcanvas","publisher":"blueberrycongee","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/blueberrycongee","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/blueberrycongee/termcanvas/releases/tag/v0.39.10","tags":["agent","agentic","ai","chatbot","claude-code","code","codex","coding","gemini-cli","large-language-model","llm","programming"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.39.10/app.json","detailSha256":"27eae8e5816c302787f59544179da8464f97ef225689c578cc19ec927d0bb924","releaseDate":"2026-05-31","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"0.39.10"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.39.9/app.json","detailSha256":"c9e5727d06ddd0f09af78d801f823fa34d92cc07a86529d2eb1f82f9409e9f19","releaseDate":"2026-05-31","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"0.39.9"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.39.8/app.json","detailSha256":"b08f60a87560df87f6d17689aeabd30134be5601ba9c9d419a836018cdc59e33","releaseDate":"2026-05-18","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"0.39.8"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.39.7/app.json","detailSha256":"1c30b68444b0d7d17bac29bc60dbaa721cb16610c048e29082ed87c6e85f9931","releaseDate":"2026-05-09","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"0.39.7"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.39.6/app.json","detailSha256":"6767fc3bd7a5a37a3a9fb8aee77df6f6944d7e4edeb743dd6ee583813b8f8f63","releaseDate":"2026-05-08","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"0.39.6"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.39.5/app.json","detailSha256":"9c611f13a368be62dc18aff97e4571cddec0a4dc529bdaec236d784b2b307611","releaseDate":"2026-05-01","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"0.39.5"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detai